&lt;p&gt;This is a field sales role that routinely requires travel for onsite customer engagement, resulting in a majority of time spent out of the office meeting with and selling to existing customers. Your focus market (although not limited to) will be the &lt;strong&gt;Thailand and Vietnam market&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in a relevant closing role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in SaaS sales for Mobile and/or Marketing Technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up-to-date on digital trends, especially in the AI, mobile, web and Customer Engagement space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intimate knowledge of the &lt;strong&gt;Thailand and Vietnam&lt;/strong&gt; technology landscape and network&lt;/li&gt;
