&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Braze, we have found our people. We’re a genuinely approachable, exceptionally kind, and intensely passionate crew.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We seek to ignite that passion by setting high standards, championing teamwork, and creating work-life harmony as we collectively navigate rapid growth on a global scale while striving for greater equity and opportunity – inside and outside our organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To flourish here, you must be prepared to set a high bar for yourself and those around you. There is always a way to contribute: Acting with autonomy, having accountability and being open to new perspectives are essential to our continued success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our deep curiosity to learn and our eagerness to share diverse passions with others gives us balance and injects a one-of-a-kind vibrancy into our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are driven to solve exhilarating challenges and have a bias toward action in the face of change, you will be empowered to make a real impact here, with a sharp and passionate team at your back. If Braze sounds like a place where you can thrive, we can’t wait to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Braze, Product Marketing sits at the center of how we bring our platform to market—shaping the narratives, positioning, and go-to-market motions that connect what we build to the value our customers feel. As part of our Product Marketing team, you&#39;ll own narratives and GTM&amp;nbsp; for the strategic technology partnerships that extend what&#39;s possible on our platform. This is a role for a builder and a storyteller: someone energized by turning complex offerings into clear, compelling go-to-market programs, and who thrives working shoulder-to-shoulder with teams across Product, Sales, Partnership, and Marketing to bring them to life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will translate Braze&#39;s strategic technology partnerships into differentiated messaging, joint go-to-market programs, and field-ready assets that ladder up to our core platform narrative.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an individual contributor role focused on strong PMM craft and cross-functional execution. You&#39;ll bring a clear understanding of how go-to-market strategies work with technology platform partners, and you&#39;ll work closely with internal cross-functional teams including Product, Partnerships, Sales, and Marketing to take initiatives from messaging through to field readiness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GTM Strategy &amp;amp; Messaging&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop GTM strategy based on joint business plans for strategic technology partnerships in collaboration with partner leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the messaging architecture for Braze&#39;s strategic technology partnerships (e.g., cloud hyperscalers and data platforms), ensuring each partnership ladders up to our core platform narrative and customer engagement story&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate platform integrations into clear, differentiated value propositions with defined customer use cases and competitive angles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Core Product Marketing to ensure technology partners are reflected accurately in product launches, campaigns, and core messaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GTM Execution &amp;amp; Enablement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive joint go-to-market and co-marketing programs with technology platform partners, coordinating timelines and deliverables across internal teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive partner launch motions end-to-end: messaging, packaging, enablement materials, and field readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and deliver core assets and enablement that actually get used in the field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track performance and adoption, and report results back to cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cross-Functional Execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product, GTM Strategy, Sales, Marketing, and Partnership to align on priorities and execute against them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales and the field to support active deals, customer conversations, and positioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your first year, success means:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A repeatable launch and enablement motion for technology platform partnerships, with integrations reflected consistently across launches, campaigns, and core messaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted, productive relationships across Product, Sales, Partners, Marketing, and Services—you&#39;re the person teams pull in early&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A storyteller. You turn complex offerings and integrations into clear, differentiated narratives that resonate with buyers and the field alike&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder. You&#39;re comfortable with ambiguity and energized by creating structure, frameworks, and repeatable motions where none existed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborator. You&#39;re a sleeves-rolled-up, low-ego operator who brings cross-functional teams along and gets things shipped without direct authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GTM-fluent. You understand how go-to-market strategies work with technology platform partners and how to execute them in a fast-moving, matrixed organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What You Bring to the Team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
