&lt;li&gt;Strong PMM fundamentals: messaging frameworks, competitive positioning, narrative development, and the ability to translate complex offerings and integrations into clear, buyer-ready stories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience marketing technology platform partnerships (e.g., cloud hyperscalers, data platforms, and the broader SaaS/martech ecosystem)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building sales and enablement content—solution briefs, battle cards, decks, playbooks—that gets adopted and used by the field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven ability to work closely with cross-functional teams and execute without direct authority, navigating a matrixed organization to get things shipped&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communicator, comfortable presenting to internal stakeholders and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
