&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a chance to shape the next chapter of one of our most strategically important channels — with a canvas that extends well beyond a single region. We&#39;re looking for a seasoned partnerships executive to take the reins of an already-thriving agency alliance program and drive it to its next level of scale and sophistication on a global stage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sitting within our Alliances organisation and reporting to the AVP of Delivery Partnerships, you will own the agency alliance strategy globally — not just execute against it. You&#39;ll be the architect of the GTM vision, acquiring and onboarding new agency partners across markets while deepening and commercialising an existing portfolio of boutique agency and consulting relationships. This is a build-and-scale mandate for someone who wants ownership, visibility, and the latitude to operate as a true business leader within the partner ecosystem — with impact that reaches across every region we operate in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will operate at the intersection of Sales and Alliances worldwide, working shoulder-to-shoulder with Sales Leadership across regions to shape program strategy, and with Account Executives globally to convert partner relationships into sourced and influenced pipeline. You&#39;ll also partner closely with regional Alliances leaders to ensure strategy, tooling, and playbooks stay coordinated and best-in-class across every market. Success here is measured in one currency above all others: quality pipeline that converts, at global scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and evolve comprehensive GTM plans with our agency partners across regions, translating strategy into quality net-new business pipeline globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the sales cycle in lockstep with our sales teams worldwide — from prospecting through deal close — in true partnership with our agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion differentiated value propositions and partner specialisms, telling that story with conviction internally at Braze, with agency leadership, and ultimately in markets around the world&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold the partnership to a standard of accountability and reciprocity, ensuring a measured flow of outsourced Braze services in exchange for net-new client opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring rigour to the business — reviewing sales play metrics and effectiveness with partners and Braze leadership across regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate cross-functionally as a connector across Tech and Cloud Partnerships, Partner Marketing, and Partner Education &amp;amp; Enablement to ensure the agency motion is fully supported everywhere we compete&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of partnerships experience in a modern cloud technology company, G/SIs, or Agency, with a track record of increasing scope and impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven, quantifiable history of driving sourced pipeline and influenced revenue through a mature SaaS partner program — you know what great looks like because you&#39;ve built it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep fluency in the agency and marketing services ecosystem: service offering design, marketing, lead generation, and the KPIs that matter to a professional services organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Firsthand experience navigating agency and consultancy environments, with an intimate understanding of their org structures, business dynamics, and how to build a compelling business case with them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated ability to lead through ambiguity, take on complex strategic and operational mandates, and scale a program across a large, distributed organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The gravitas and executive presence to represent Braze credibly with senior partner and internal stakeholders, paired with the grit and resilience to keep pushing when the path isn&#39;t linear&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel across the globe as needed to invest in your most strategic partner relationships&lt;/li&gt;
