&lt;p&gt;If you are driven to solve exhilarating challenges and have a bias toward action in the face of change, you will be empowered to make a real impact here, with a sharp and passionate team at your back. If Braze sounds like a place where you can thrive, we can’t wait to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Enterprise Account Executive, you will manage a select portfolio of high-value retail accounts and actively pursue new strategic clients. Your focus will be on building deep relationships that drive revenue growth and ensure exceptional customer satisfaction. The ideal candidate is a strategic thinker with a proven track record in enterprise sales and account management.&lt;/p&gt;
