&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8–10+ years of experience in creative project management, creative operations, or production management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading operations for in-house creative or brand teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply fluent in creative workflows across brand, campaigns, video, motion, and events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted communicator who can influence without authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in fast-paced, high-growth environments&lt;/li&gt;
