&lt;p&gt;As a senior engineer on the team, you will build new capabilities, improve reliability and performance, and help guide key architectural decisions as we scale. You’ll help drive ambitious initiatives that expand what customers can build on high-value surfaces, unlock new ways to present and orchestrate content, and strengthen platform foundations that accelerate future innovation across in-product channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value engineers who consistently raise the bar through strong technical leadership, thoughtful system design, and clear communication.&lt;/p&gt;
