&lt;li&gt;Professional experience with Python/Django, React, Ruby on Rails, Snowflake, microservice architecture, and distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with modern data warehousing, BI, and analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with agile processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for incrementally delivering high-quality software which delights customers&lt;/li&gt;
