&lt;p&gt;Our deep curiosity to learn and our eagerness to share diverse passions with others gives us balance and injects a one-of-a-kind vibrancy into our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are driven to solve exhilarating challenges and have a bias toward action in the face of change, you will be empowered to make a real impact here, with a sharp and passionate team at your back. If Braze sounds like a place where you can thrive, we can’t wait to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Engineer on Braze’s AI Decisioning Experience team, you will play a pivotal role in shaping the future of our AI decisioning (reinforcement learning-based personalization) solutions. You will lead high-impact initiatives, mentor other engineers, and collaborate with cross-functional teams to drive innovation and excellence in our product offerings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading high-impact initiatives across Decisioning Studio, Braze&#39;s AI Decisioning product line, on both the self-serve DS Go and managed DS Pro tiers: agent setup, creative, and launch workflows, the reporting that helps marketers understand and trust the results, and the services that connect the UX to our ML pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating closely with Product, Design, and ML engineering teams to turn a fast-moving AI product roadmap into intuitive, reliable software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building the full stack of these experiences, from dashboard UI down to the APIs and services that connect the Braze platform to our ML pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading efforts in web application architecture to ensure scalability, maintainability, and performance across our platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influencing Braze’s product strategy and roadmap by providing technical insights and driving innovation in user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentoring engineers, providing guidance on technical growth, and fostering a high-performance engineering culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting teams implementing Braze’s AI solutions to ensure customer success and facilitate effective collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 7+ years of relevant experience with a strong track record of delivering impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work comfortably across the full stack: you can design and build the data models, APIs, and background jobs behind your features, and own a product surface end to end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are a strong frontend developer (TypeScript, React; Vue experience is a plus) with a high bar for polished, intuitive user experiences, including the testing discipline to keep them reliable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a strong background in designing and maintaining scalable web application architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are an expert practitioner of agentic development: AI coding agents are your default workflow, you build reusable skills and automation that raise the whole team&#39;s velocity, and you have a track record of dramatically above-baseline throughput without sacrificing quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate with clarity in writing and in person: you produce design docs and technical proposals that people actually read, and you can explain complex systems to engineers, product partners, and stakeholders alike&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a user-centric attitude and are passionate about creating exceptional user experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take pride in writing elegant, maintainable code and fostering a culture of quality within your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable navigating a large codebase with multiple stakeholders and driving consensus on technical decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience mentoring engineers and contributing to their technical development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
