&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing user experiences for machine learning and data-intensive applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building product surfaces on top of LLMs and agentic systems (embeddings, agent orchestration, evaluation)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Python and/or Ruby on Rails&lt;/li&gt;
